This repository contains the code for my project which implements a VGG style neural network to recognize letters from the Bulgarian Dactylic Alphabet. If you want to try it out you can download the zip file containing the executable and all of the required information from this link to my drive: https://drive.google.com/file/d/17hFBpcfheOSHMR3a1k-Y5rhoojfhq5_d/view?usp=sharing
